sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Runner as "GitHub Actions / Runner"
    participant Deploy as "deploy.py"
    participant EntraID as "Microsoft Entra ID"
    participant FabricAPI as "Microsoft Fabric REST API"
    participant FabricWS as "FabricWorkspace Instance"
    participant FabricCICD as "fabric_cicd Module"

    Runner->>Deploy: Run with credentials, env & workspace arguments
    Note over Deploy: Appends 'enable_shortcut_publish' feature flag & sets log level to DEBUG
    
    Deploy->>EntraID: Request Auth Token (via ClientSecretCredential)
    EntraID-->>Deploy: Return Access Token

    alt workspaceid argument provided
        Note over Deploy: Use provided Workspace ID directly
    else workspacename argument provided (or resolved via env variable)
        Deploy->>FabricAPI: GET /v1/workspaces (with Token)
        FabricAPI-->>Deploy: Return Workspace List
        Note over Deploy: Match target display name & extract workspace UUID
    end

    Deploy->>FabricWS: Instantiate FabricWorkspace (with ID, repo path, credentials & item scope)
    FabricWS-->>Deploy: Return initialized workspace context object

    Deploy->>FabricCICD: publish_all_items(target_workspace)
    activate FabricCICD
    Note over FabricCICD: Scans local 'fabric' folder and publishes notebooks, pipelines, etc.
    FabricCICD-->>Deploy: Publishing completed
    deactivate FabricCICD

    Deploy->>FabricCICD: unpublish_all_orphan_items(target_workspace)
    activate FabricCICD
    Note over FabricCICD: Compares local & remote items, deleting those no longer in repository
    FabricCICD-->>Deploy: Orphan cleanup completed
    deactivate FabricCICD

    Deploy-->>Runner: Script completed successfully
